notes.content:
Smart collections allow you to find a server to your taste! We automatically update them and try to make sure that the servers inside meet your expectations!

Don't know what to play? Check out the Browse page - there we have organized collections that you will definitely like.

[list]
[*] added smart collections on the Browse page!
[*] search is correct and optimized now;
[*] significantly reduced loading time;
[*] fixed application scaling when double-clicking on top navigation menu;
[*] main window bounds are stored in steam cloud now;
[*] now you can maximize the application window when dragging it to the screen border;
[*] added a loading bar at the top of pages.
[/list]
